        "Those neither owning nor renting (V10437=8): Dwelling value, assumed to be 10 times "
        "the value of rent received free in return for services (V10028), divided by the "
        "number of rooms (V10432) Note that the maximum value for V10432, excluding missing "
        "data, is 8, so data values in this variable are inflated for a few cases.",
